  },
  {
    "about": "a row four columns in ends the table, code",
    "markdown": "| a |\n|---|\n    b\n",
    "html": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>a</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n</table>\n<pre><code>b\n</code></pre>\n"
  },
  {
    "about": "a row three columns in is still a row",
    "markdown": "| a |\n|---|\n   b\n",
    "html": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>a</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>b</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"
  },
  {
    "about": "a lazy line heads no table",
    "markdown": "* w\n| w | x |\n|---|---|\n",
