  },
  {
    "about": "a lazy line in a quote in an item heads no table",
    "markdown": "- > w\n| w | x |\n|---|---|\n",
    "html": "<ul>\n<li>\n<blockquote>\n<p>w\n| w | x |\n|---|---|</p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n"
  },
  {
    "about": "a delimiter row that fit no head leaves the paragraph tried",
